5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. To ensure this transition is sustainable, I would like to examine administrator retirements and hiring times, as well as the records of depot supervisors and the last rollout.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to help pick the new system! I want to make sure it actually works for the people on the floor, so I'll check the yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I believe we must look beyond the initial proposal. I will examine the five years of renewal invoices and the board minutes on capital and operating requests to understand the true long-term costs.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Hello everyone! I'm so happy to be part of this team! I want to make sure we're all supported if things get tricky, so I'll look into support ownership during last winter's outage and the upgrade history of the dispatch tool!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A most comprehensive start. To ensure we aren't merely replacing one legacy burden with another, I shall examine the data lift in the 2018 pay move and the warehouse rule changes after new accounts.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I believe we have a well-rounded set of priorities. By looking at both the financial history and the operational impact on our staff, we can avoid making a decision based on surface-level promises.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I totally agree, Misaki! It's all about the real-world stuff. I'm also going to look into the depot calendar and the peak-season cutover, because we can't have the system crashing when things get super busy!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I agree. A system's value is not found in its launch, but in its endurance. I believe the records I have chosen will reveal the patterns of expenditure that often remain hidden.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"That sounds like a great idea, Kenji! I want to make sure everyone stays happy and stress-free, so I'll stick with my choices to see how we handle the tough moments. I'm looking forward to it!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Kenji. A system that falters during the peak season is not a tool, but a liability. I shall remain with my selections; the ghosts of past data migrations often whisper the most honest warnings.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I agree. It is better to be cautious now than to face an unsustainable burden later. I am satisfied with our chosen areas of investigation and am ready to see the results.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready too! I can't wait to see what we find out. Let's make sure we pick something that really helps the team on the ground!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
17,1,3,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I concur. We have a balanced approach. I am ready to review the findings and see if the financial reality matches the projections.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I'm ready too! I hope the information we find helps us make a choice that keeps everyone feeling supported and happy. Let's do our best!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
20,1,3,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
21,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,It appears we have reached a consensus with remarkable efficiency. I shall await the revelations of the archives with a measured curiosity. I am ready to proceed.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
